abstract: >-
  Agentic Movie Studio is a local-first macOS filmmaking application that
  coordinates a role-based local-model crew across screenplay development,
  breakdown, continuity bibles, shot planning, prompts, storyboard stills,
  image-to-video rendering, take review, and final movie assembly.
